    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Aug 2025 13:01:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我的赛博朋友们好久不见🙌不知不觉就已经高三了，终于赶在夏天结束前把这期播客发了出来</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期intro</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>【在高中】</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">1:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">9:27</a>高三补课：从来没这么累过</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">9:36</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a>进入高三，开始学着自我接纳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a>逐渐不再像高一高二那样过度被外界消耗</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>【一些读到看到的好东西】</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a>韩女文学：《关于女儿》《对我无害之人》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">39:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a>《为什么长大？》：即使长大也可以理想主义</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2897">48:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3059">50:59</a>完结撒花:快快再见吧应试教育</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><strong><span>What Was I Made For?</span></strong><span>-Billie Eilish</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Candy Can</span></strong><span>-Kidult.</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>播客中提到的文学及影视作品</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《你的夏天还好吗？》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《关于女儿》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《对我无害之人》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《明亮的夜晚》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《秋园》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《壁花少年》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《为什么长大？》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《昨日青春》</span></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://b23.tv/h9lCvnn" data-url="https://b23.tv/h9lCvnn"><span>轻盈地抗争是种很性感的东亚青春</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg1hlDGPeUTTyNkhJNBaVexl7V4J.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
