    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>大家好久不见！我回来啦！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>开学之后真的很</span><strong><span>忙忙忙忙</span></strong><span>，前段时间现实生活中也是烂摊子烂情绪一堆，有时候都处理不过来，毫无表达欲望。但是！我相信一切都在慢慢变好！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>本期intro</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">9:30</a>开学后的生活和运动会</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">9:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a>最近看书时的一些思考</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a>重看了一遍我的人生电影《卧虎藏龙》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1663">27:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a>好剧推荐！《善意的竞争》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a>随便聊聊我的生活状态</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>播客中提到的书和影片</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《刘擎西方现代思想讲义》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《面纱》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《卧虎藏龙》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>电视剧《风声》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《善意的竞争》</span></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://b23.tv/6QHVpSC" data-url="https://b23.tv/6QHVpSC"><span>一个特别厉害的《善竞》二创</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgyqyQn-v_kw0VXue9g_CUnOwQ0h.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjbpRYXfE99QYdfYgRAPf4pHHyhO.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><a href="http://xhslink.com/a/maaNCllcpx49" data-url="http://xhslink.com/a/maaNCllcpx49"><span>玉娇龙的困局</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqoEiByx-Q-hhpaf-PwqVlxjFmWe.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎵Things You Said—Cody Fry / Abby Cates</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦恩莉—方大同</span></p>]]></description>
